It is late at night, but the summer sky is still deep blue.
It is not really dark.
I am standing in the flat and tidying up my things.
I put the mobile phone on the table.
Then I put the backpack in the corner.
I look out the window and think about the time since January.
My arrival in winter was incredibly cold.
Then there was the registration at the office, and everything was so new.
My first day at the office was also very exciting.
In March I finally had a thick winter coat.
Later I was at the badminton club for the first time.
Now it is already June, and the dark days are over.
It was a completely normal summer birthday, but it was perfect.
I had a wonderful birthday today.
The evening was exactly what I wanted.
Berlin was so big and foreign at first, but now it is my city.
I am completely in the moment and enjoying the warm night.
I am now thirty-two years old and I am happy.
